    "description": "## Impact\r\n\r\nIn OpenBao's UI, an open redirect existed in the OIDC ID provider, affecting users not authenticated to OpenBao.\r\n\r\nThis vulnerability is original to HashiCorp Vault.\r\n\r\n## Patch\r\n\r\nThis vulnerability is patched in OpenBao v2.7.0 and v2.6.3.\r\n\r\n## Workarounds\r\n\r\nOpenBao's UI is not activated by default. Consider setting `ui = false` to explicitly disable it.",
